abstract: "Self-contained Python implementation of the fixed RC-RMI occupation–industry instrument, with recorded component judgments, scales, combination rules, crosswalk, synthetic examples and full-domain checks. It reproduces frozen rule application under three specifications, not empirical employment matching or individual-duty validation."
